  "abstract": "In this chapter, we review the Ra\u02dcnada \ufb01eld line solutions of Maxwell\u2019s equations in the vacuum, which describe a topologically non-trivial electro- magnetic \ufb01eld, as well as their relation with the knot theory. Also, we present a generalization of these solutions to the non-linear electrodynamics recently published in the literature.",
